### **Phase 4: Risk 9 (Security Logging & Monitoring)** — Tasks 34–45

34. **Logging frameworks** — SLF4J, Logback, Log4j 2 (post-CVE-2021-44228 configs)
35. **Audit trail design** — What to log, sensitive data redaction, immutability
36. **Intrusion detection** — Anomaly detection, alert thresholds, SIEM integration

